20:25:37.244 SET-FIELD PROBE IS ON - which by now means 'the channel answers at all'. The
20:25:37.244   flag is a misnomer kept for the launch line: without it Session::handle
20:25:37.244   returns nothing for every packet, so the migration hello goes unanswered and
20:25:37.245   the client freezes on 'Connecting...'.
20:25:37.245   With it on, this channel answers: the migration hello with a SetField
20:25:37.245   carrying the character's real record (presence[0] the stat block, presence[2]
20:25:37.245   the equipped list), 0x00DC with that field's NPCs and mobs, 0x00D1 with the
20:25:37.245   portal's destination, 0x00E7 with the !map GM command, and 0x0151 with a
20:25:37.245   script Say. Equipment, mobs and the Say are BUILT BUT UNCONFIRMED on screen.
